      "id": "frag-6",
      "focal_uid": 6,
      "title": "Traders amplify the mood",
      "insight": "Where the financial bets land. Real interest rates and geopolitical nerves push futures positioning, and that positioning flows into both the price and ETF holdings. It's the market's short-term accelerator \u2014 it doesn't set gold's direction on its own, it exaggerates whatever the rates-and-risk backdrop is already saying.",
