    {
      "id": "frag-15",
      "focal_uid": 15,
      "title": "Flight to safety",
      "insight": "Gold's safe-haven engine. Rising recession odds and the level of real rates both run through financial stress, which lands on the price and on Chinese demand. It's the classic flight to safety \u2014 when growth wobbles and markets turn jittery, this channel carries the fear into gold.",
