    {
      "id": "frag-10",
      "focal_uid": 10,
      "title": "Why people hold gold at all",
      "insight": "Geopolitical friction and swelling US deficits stoke inflation, and inflation works on gold two ways at once \u2014 directly, and by pushing on real interest rates and Chinese demand. It's the hinge between the fiscal-and-political backdrop and the rates that ultimately price gold.",
